You missed the best part.  Try doing the same thing with and amulet of
refl. or intrinsic shock resistance AND intrinsic disintegration resistance
(maybe black drag scale might work too).

Anyway, with shock res. and disint res. intrinsics you get the following:

	Suddenly a bolt of lightning hits you --More--
	It seems not to affect you. --More--
	However, the ensuing disintegration beam does.  --More--
	You bask in the disintegration beam for a minute...--More--
	A voice rings out: "I believe it not!"  You finish your prayer.

I *LOVED* it!  What a great laugh!  Just one more of the endless details those
guys dreamt up.

Happy hacking,
